Fixes
- More improvement in start-up speed
- Better improvement and less freeze-ups/semi crashes when mass downloading across consecutive waves
- R34-React infinite scroll fix (still working on this)
- Number of workers downgraded to max. 10
- Opening a link/image to a new tab now opens to the right of the active tab
- 
| New queue downloads	| Folder and filename layout |
  | --- | --- |
  | E-Hentai, ExHentai, and similar gallery sites |	Site\Gallery title\original-filename.ext |
| Rule34 and booru sites |	Site\Search tags\Posting date\01 - original-filename.ext, with a short identifier to prevent filename collisions. If search tags are unavailable, FileFapper uses the post’s tags when available. |
| Comix, JMComic, and other chapter readers	| Site\Chapter title\0001.ext, numbered in reading order. JMComic also filters repeated chapter links and page URLs during download. |
| Pixiv, Kemono, and Pawchive	| By default, Site\Author - ID\Posting date\Post title\files. Choose the flat option in Preferences → Creator download layout to save files directly in the author folder with dates in their filenames. |

Additions
- Simultaneous galleries is now max. 25
- (Pixiv, Kemono and Pawchive tasks) You can choose to download files directly inside the author's folder, or have the author's folder with sub-folders
- Reload all tabs (just don't use this when you have a lot of tabs, it will cause an error)
- (Rule34 and booru sites) Skip duplicate images, replace with highres or larger copies, or keep all images
- Compare image download duplicates from one site that you're downloading, or all current sites
